        "row_count": 7
      }
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00017",
      "block_type": "heading",
      "text": "Defence and security contracts",
      "ordinal": 17,
      "heading_path": [
        "What are thresholds?",
        "Key points and policy intent",
        "Defence and security contracts"
      ],
      "source_locator": "details.body",
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00018",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "10. It has been standard practice to update the defence and security thresholds, set out in rows 1 to 3 of Schedule 1, to keep pace with the GPA thresholds (although there is no international obligation to do so). The up to date thresholds are set out in the table below:",
      "ordinal": 18,
      "heading_path": [
        "What are thresholds?",
        "Key points and policy intent",
        "Defence and security contracts"
      ],
      "source_locator": "details.body",
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00019",
      "block_type": "table",
      "text": "Type of contract\tThresholds (including VAT): 1 January 2026 to 31 December 2027\nDefence and security contract that is a works contract\t£5,193,000\nDefence and security contract that is a concession contract\t£5,193,000\nDefence and security contract that is not a works contract, a concession contract or a light touch contract (i.e. goods and services)\t£415,440",
      "ordinal": 19,
      "heading_path": [
        "What are thresholds?",
        "Key points and policy intent",
        "Defence and security contracts"
      ],
      "source_locator": "details.body",
      "metadata": {
        "rows": [
          [
            "Type of contract",
            "Thresholds (including VAT): 1 January 2026 to 31 December 2027"
          ],
          [
            "Defence and security contract that is a works contract",
            "£5,193,000"
          ],
          [
            "Defence and security contract that is a concession contract",
            "£5,193,000"
          ],
          [
            "Defence and security contract that is not a works contract, a concession contract or a light touch contract (i.e. goods and services)",
            "£415,440"
          ]
        ],
        "row_count": 4
      }
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00020",
      "block_type": "heading",
      "text": "Light touch contracts",
      "ordinal": 20,
      "heading_path": [
        "What are thresholds?",
        "Key points and policy intent",
        "Light touch contracts"
      ],
      "source_locator": "details.body",
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00021",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "11. Paragraph 3 of Schedule 1 provides a power to update the thresholds for light touch contracts set out in rows 5, 7 and 8 of Schedule 1. These thresholds are not determined by the GPA and as such are not subject to change every two years.",
      "ordinal": 21,
      "heading_path": [
        "What are thresholds?",
        "Key points and policy intent",
        "Light touch contracts"
      ],
      "source_locator": "details.body",
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00022",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "12. While it’s not necessary to formally align the light touch contracts thresholds with the GPA thresholds, the thresholds may be updated for other purposes, for example to allow for inflation or reflect changing priorities for this category of contract.",
      "ordinal": 22,
      "heading_path": [
        "What are thresholds?",
        "Key points and policy intent",
        "Light touch contracts"
      ],
      "source_locator": "details.body",
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00023",
      "block_type": "table",
      "text": "Type of contract\tThreshold (including VAT)\nLight touch utilities contract\t£884,720\nLight touch concession contract\t£5,372,609\nAll other light touch contracts\t£663,540",
      "ordinal": 23,
      "heading_path": [
        "What are thresholds?",
        "Key points and policy intent",
        "Light touch contracts"
      ],
      "source_locator": "details.body",
      "metadata": {
