    {
      "block_id": "b00037",
      "block_type": "li",
      "text": "Section 123 of the Act, ‘Interpretation’, explains that a reference to an amount payable or paid, receivable or received, or to be paid or received, under a contract includes a reference to any amount referable to VAT (the terms receivable and received are used to reflect the different way in which concession contracts are valued). ↩",
      "ordinal": 37,
      "heading_path": [
